{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01484","headline":"舞曲歌辞 独漉篇 · 李白","name":"舞曲歌辞 独漉篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独漉水中泥，水浊不见月。\n不见月尚可，水深行人没。\n越鸟从南来，胡鹰亦北度。\n我欲弯弓向天射，惜其中道失归路。\n落叶别树，飘零随风。\n客无所托，悲与此同。\n罗帷舒卷，似有人开。\n明月直入，无心可猜。\n雄劒挂壁，时时龙鸣。\n不断犀象，绣涩苔生。\n国耻未雪，何由成名。\n神鹰梦泽，不顾鸱鸢。\n爲君一击，抟鹏九天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01484.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01484","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}